    <p>19.1 The Website is provided "as is" and on an "as available" basis. 2Ways Consultancy uses industry best practices to provide a high uptime. We give no warranty that the Website or Facilities will be free of defects and/or faults, and we do not provide any kind of refund for outages. We provide no warranties (express or implied) of fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy of information, compatibility, and satisfactory quality.</p>
